    MIT License. See third_party/me-core/LICENSE.md for the full text.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on standby
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
With the Media Engine driving the effects, the PSP's standby (lid close)
is held off. This is a deliberate trade for the second core doing real
work. PSPATTERN is under active development and testing.
